From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rui Figueira <rfigueira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 00:29:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] UA stylesheet: strip box chrome from input[type=range]

The generic input border/padding/background painted a box around the
slider widget. Chrome's UA sheet strips these for range; width
mirrors Chrome's 129px default intrinsic size.
---
 assets/default.css | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/assets/default.css b/assets/default.css
index ad76a97..03060be 100644
--- a/assets/default.css
+++ b/assets/default.css
@@ -90,6 +90,18 @@ textarea {
     font-family: monospace;
 }

+/* Range sliders draw their own UA widget (track + thumb,
+   blitz-paint form_controls). The generic input box chrome must not
+   paint underneath: Chrome's UA sheet likewise strips it. Width
+   mirrors Chrome's default 129px intrinsic size. */
+input[type="range"] {
+    border: none;
+    padding: 0;
+    background-color: transparent;
+    width: 129px;
+    height: 1.3em;
+}
+
 input:focus,
 textarea:focus {
     outline: 2px solid #4D90FE;
